<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Changelog | Turnstile</title><description>Updates to Turnstile</description><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog</link><item><title>Turnstile - Swahili language support</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#swahili-language-support</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#swahili-language-support</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Turnstile now supports Swahili (Kenya). Set the widget&apos;s &lt;code&gt;language&lt;/code&gt; option or &lt;code&gt;data-language&lt;/code&gt; attribute to &lt;code&gt;sw&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;sw-ke&lt;/code&gt;, or use &lt;code&gt;auto&lt;/code&gt; to follow the visitor&apos;s browser language preference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/reference/supported-languages/&quot;&gt;supported languages&lt;/a&gt; for the full list of languages and language codes.&lt;/p&gt;
</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2026-11-02</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2026-11-02</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2026-11-02</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved Turnstile widget responsiveness in narrow layouts and at increased browser zoom levels. The widget retains its standard width when space allows and adapts to narrower containers to improve accessibility. For sizing options, refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/client-side-rendering/widget-configurations/#widget-sizes&quot;&gt;Widget sizes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2026-07-22</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2026-07-22</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2026-07-22</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turnstile may now make requests to &lt;code&gt;hagen.challenges.cloudflare.com&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;brunhild.challenges.cloudflare.com&lt;/code&gt; as part of browser verification. Add both hostnames to your network allowlist so Turnstile can access them. For more information, refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-challenges/troubleshooting/challenge-solve-issues/#failed-subdomain-network-requests-during-turnstile-challenges&quot;&gt;Failed subdomain network requests during Turnstile challenges&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2024-08-12</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2024-08-12</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2024-08-12</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/client-side-rendering/#widget-size&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;[flexible]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; width widget size.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added new dimensions for Turnstile&apos;s compact size.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a Feedback Report toggle on the widget&apos;s configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2024-04-10</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2024-04-10</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2024-04-10</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/client-side-rendering/#refresh-a-timed-out-widget&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;[refresh-timeout]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and document new automatic interactive timeout-refresh.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><pubDate>Wed, 10 Apr 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2024-03-25</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2024-03-25</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2024-03-25</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
