</description><pubDate>Wed, 01 Feb 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2022-12-12</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2022-12-12</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2022-12-12</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
