</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Oct 2022 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Turnstile - 2022-10-11</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2022-10-11</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/changelog/#2022-10-11</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
